        "created_at": "2015-09-01T15:07:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Can't you sprint/nimble the second time and still get a free sprint/nimble out of Unrelenting, or do I understand it wrong?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes. &nbsp;You can sprint/nimble, then sprint/nimble, then get the third sprint/nimble for free. &nbsp;I was trying to cover the unusual cases and didn't cover the normal case first. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Edit: Or you can sprint, sprint, sprint/nimble for free.&nbsp;</p>",
